/*
  When you dispatch fetchUsers(), RTK executes this timeline automatically:

  Time 0ms: 
  Dispatch: { type: 'users/fetchUsers/pending' }
  UI Update: Spinner appears.

  Time 500ms (Internet doing work...)

  Time 1000ms: Promise Resolves!
  Dispatch: { type: 'users/fetchUsers/fulfilled', payload: [user1, user2] }
  UI Update: Spinner hides, Users appear on screen.

  OR Time 1000ms: Server Crashes!
  Dispatch: { type: 'users/fetchUsers/rejected', error: { message: '500' } }
  UI Update: Spinner hides, Error Toast pops up.
*/
